ategic planning. \n\nPresident Ryan''s software division. Leads a team of dedicated tax and technology experts responsible for the continued development and support of the Firm’s expanding suite of software applications. Driving the growth of Ryan’s new proprietary software offering that includes PinPoint™, a powerful sales and use tax calculation engine and data warehousing application; RatePoint™, a single-source tax application for rate lookup and monitoring needs; FilePoint™, a sales and use tax compliance system that provides access to the largest body of electronic uploads in the market for sales and use tax filings; and ControlPoint™, a certificate management system for handling and sharing purchase and/or sales exemption certificates.","employer":{"organization_id":7264,"name":"Ryan","slug":"ryan","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/ryan/","sumble_url":"https://sumble.com/l/org/EODjf5B19rxQ"}},{"title":"Member Of The Board Of Advisors","start_date":"2015-02","end_date":"2018-09","duration":"3 years 8 months","employer":{"organization_id":7264,"name":"Ryan","slug":"ryan","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/ryan/","sumble_url":"https://sumble.com/l/org/EODjf5B19rxQ"}},{"title":"CEO","start_date":"2009-05","end_date":"2015-02","duration":"5 years 10 months","description":"*A Ryan, LLC spin-off that was re-acquired by Ryan in 2015*, Second Decimal was a technology company that transformed corporate tax departments through an innovative approach and design that combined the power of tax expertise and technology. Second Decimal infused the intellectual capital of the most seasoned tax and technology experts in the industry with a suite of intuitive and powerful software applications that exponentially improved accuracy, productivity, and processes. \n\nWith an integrated suite of workflow, tax calculation, and certificate management software products designed and supported by developers with corporate tax advisory experience, Second Decim