mens, Slack, T-Mobile, Takeda, Teach for America, and Twilio, trust Okta to help protect the identities of their workforces and customers. I’m responsible for all aspects of the Okta customer journey, from initial brand awareness to deployment, customer and partner success, renewal and expansion — ensuring organizations maximize the value of the Okta Identity Cloud to unleash their full potential. My team includes worldwide sales, customer success and support, professional services, partner and channel ecosystems, customer solutions, marketing and brand, and GTM strategy and operations.","employer":{"organization_id":731,"name":"Okta, Inc.","slug":"okta","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/okta-inc-","sumble_url":"https://sumble.com/l/org/UPUK9qdND2O"}},{"title":"Board Member","start_date":"2018-03","end_date":"2023-03","employer":{"organization_id":1586,"name":"HashiCorp","slug":"hashicorp","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/hashicorp","sumble_url":"https://sumble.com/l/org/Uv0K9qdND2O"}},{"title":"President, Worldwide Field Operations","start_date":"2017-10","end_date":"2021-02","location":"San Francisco Bay Area","description":"In October 2017, I was appointed President of Worldwide Field Operations to oversee global sales, customer success and marketing.","employer":{"name":"Splunk","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/20226"}},{"title":"Chief Revenue Officer","start_date":"2016-05","end_date":"2021-02","location":"San Francisco Bay Area","employer":{"name":"Splunk","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/20226"}},{"title":"Chief Revenue Officer, Marketing Cloud","start_date":"2012-08","end_date":"2016-03","location":"San Francisco Bay Area","employer":{"name":"salesforce.com","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/3185"}},{"title":"President, Buddy Media","start_date":"2012-03","end_date":"2012-08","employer":{"name":"salesforce.com","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/3185"}},{"title":"Pres